  {
    "name": "project_write_plan",
    "description": "Calls the offered tool project.write_plan (evidenceLoop.tools describes it); its input goes in input.",
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "summary": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Original constraints: minLength: 1; maxLength: 240."
        },
        "callId": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Original constraints: pattern: \"^[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]{1,200}$\"."
        },
        "input": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "taskSpec": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "parts": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "quote": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "sourceId": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "text": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "sourceId",
                          "text"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      },
                      "goalFacts": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "lastingActs": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "move_money",
                            "delete",
                            "send_or_publish",
                            "modify_existing",
                            "create_new"
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "answer": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "kind": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "records"
                            ]
                          },
                          "columns": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "items": {
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          },
                          "rows": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "description": "Optional. How many rows the answer asks for, where the person's words say a number: count for exactly that many, or atLeast, atMost or both for a range, each a whole number from 1 to 10000, never count beside atLeast or atMost (the 5 newest books is {count: 5}; at least 3 reviews is {atLeast: 3}; up to 10 titles is {atMost: 10}). Leave it out where the words give no number of rows.",
                            "properties": {
                              "count": {
                                "type": "integer"
                              },
                              "atLeast": {
                                "type": "integer"
                              },
                              "atMost": {
                                "type": "integer"
                              }
                            },
                            "additionalProperties": false
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "kind",
                          "columns"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      },
                      "effect": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "description": "Optional. The change this part asks for, as data. kind change: direction adds or removes, count a whole number from 1 to 1000 or \"each_match\" where the request names a condition and no number, and what is the thing changed; it is judged by the difference between the state before the run and the state after it (placing holds on 2 books is change, adds, 2, \"holds on books\"). kind end_state: state is what must hold after the run; it is judged by the state after the run alone (setting the reading-room alert to email is end_state, \"the reading-room alert is email\"). adds needs create_new or modify_existing in lastingActs, removes needs delete or modify_existing, end_state needs modify_existing. A part that only reads or opens something declares none.",
                        "properties": {
                          "kind": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "change",
                              "end_state"
                            ]
                          },
                          "direction": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "adds",
                              "removes"
                            ]
                          },
                          "count": {
                            "type": [
                              "integer",
                              "string"
                            ]
                          },
                          "what": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "state": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "kind"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "id",
                      "quote",
                      "goalFacts",
                      "lastingActs"
                    ],
                    "additionalProperties": false
                  }
                },
                "notAsked": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "unchanged": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "description": "Optional. Things that must show no change, judged relative to the state before the run, for example leave other holds as they are is \"other holds\". Original constraints: maxItems: 20."
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "parts"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "subflows": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "key": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "purpose": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "parts": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "inputs": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "outputs": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "after": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "key",
                  "name",
                  "parts"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            },
            "reason": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "taskSpec",
            "subflows"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "summary",
        "callId",
        "input"
      ]
    },
    "strict": true
  },
